# dev/marketing files that must never reach the release zip. The runtime set is
# spelled out in .pkgmeta; this list is the belt to its braces, and it also
# keeps hand-built zips clean.
CURSEFORGE.md
CHANGELOG-dev.md
NearbySpy-icon.png
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# NOTE: tests/ used to be ignored here with an allowlist of individual files
# (!tests/test_x.py). Every test added later was silently left out of the
# repository unless somebody remembered to add another "!" line — 12 of 38 test
# files existed only in the working copy, and a broken one (test_hub_minimap,
# red since 1.4.0) stayed red because nothing ran it. Track the whole directory;
# .pkgmeta already excludes it from the release zip.
